    "title": "4 ways Penn State can overcome Koby Howard injury against Wisconsin - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Donohue ,\n1 days ago Through three weeks of the 2026 season, Penn State football receiver Koby Howard was performing at a level we've not seen from his position in Happy Valley since Jahan Dotson's 2021 All-American campaign. National buzz was building before a Big Ten opener against Wisconsin but it turns out Howard won't be available Saturday and likely for the near future. Read full article",
